{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22273","headline":"清调吟 · 白居易","name":"清调吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"索索风戒寒，沈沈日藏耀。\n劝君饮浊醪，听我吟清调。\n芳节变穷阴，朝光成夕照。\n与君生此世，不合长年少。\n今晨从此过，明日安能料。\n若不结跏禅，即须开口笑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}